  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Auth status"
 },
 "description": "X (Twitter): report the active auth mode, the authenticated user (in user mode), granted OAuth scopes, the credential backend, detected availability, and the resolved policy matrix. Degrades to a defined shape under app-only auth (no user; a note explains the limitation).",
